Aim-TTI,TSX1820P,000000,SIM1.0
# RETURNS 0
##
reset
# COMMAND
ttitsx -S reset
# OUTPUT

# RETURNS 0
##
voltage
# COMMAND
ttitsx -S voltage
# OUTPUT
1.2
# RETURNS 0
##
set voltage
# COMMAND
ttitsx -S voltage  5.0
# OUTPUT
5.0
# RETURNS 0
##
set voltage prohibited
# COMMAND
ttitsx -S voltage  500.0
# OUTPUT
ValidationError: Value 500.0 does not pass verifier _is_numeric for set() on setting VOLTAGE for device TTITSX.
Allowable values: Numbers in range [-120:120]
# RETURNS 1
